  "body_html": "<p>Week #1 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/band-of-the-week-1-viewer/\">VIEWER, YORK UK</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone\" height=\"506\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/unnamed.jpg\" width=\"506\"/></p>\n<p>Week #2 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/radio-radio/\">Radio Radio – South London, UK</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/radioradio.jpg\"><img alt=\"radioradio\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4097\" height=\"477\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/radioradio.jpg\" width=\"636\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Week #3 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/black-eskimo/\">Black Eskimo – New Hampshire, US<br/>\n</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/black-eskimo.jpg\"><img alt=\"black eskimo\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4144\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/01/black-eskimo.jpg\" width=\"520\"/></a></p>\n<p>Week #4 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/o-h/\">O.H. – Sofia, Bulgaria</a></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone\" height=\"463\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/unnamed.jpg\" width=\"455\"/></p>\n<p>Week #5 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/the-clover-club/\">The Clover Club – Tennessee, US</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/The_clower+club_watermark.jpg\"><img alt=\"The_clower+club_watermark\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4251\" height=\"791\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/The_clower+club_watermark.jpg\" width=\"791\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Week #6 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/katya-sanna/\">Katya Sanna – Italy</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/10000255_10202799045164938_1168883400_n.jpg\"><img alt=\"10000255_10202799045164938_1168883400_n\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4370\" height=\"304\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/10000255_10202799045164938_1168883400_n.jpg\" width=\"451\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Week #7 – <a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/and-the-new-band-of-the-week-winner-is/\">Voltage, Bulgaria</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/image6.jpg\"><img alt=\"image6\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4385\" height=\"488\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/image6.jpg\" width=\"650\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Week #8 – DK500,<a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/dk5600/\"> Trieste/Rome, Italy</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/1467342_228761790626659_429329374_n.jpg\"><img alt=\"1467342_228761790626659_429329374_n\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4467\" height=\"708\" src=\"https://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/1467342_228761790626659_429329374_n.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Week #9 – Dolls, London, UK</p>\n<p> </p>",
